          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Kuhnar",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 11,
            y: 4,
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Fruby.png",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Rugnur",
            x: 12,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Thursagan",
            unit: "Thursagan",
            x: 12,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Baglur",
            unit: "Baglur",
            x: 15,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Alanin",
            unit: "Alanin",
            x: 16,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Krawg",
            unit: "Krawg",
            x: 16,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Lord Durstorn, we have succeeded in our mission. Thursagan is here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("What? You mean you found Thursagan and got him to return with you? Astounding! But what is that gryphon doing here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Yes, we did get Thursagan to come along. And that is Krawg, who helped us in the Northlands."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("Yaa! Krawg!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Now, where is this ruby that I am to work with, eh Durstorn?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("Where I can keep an eye on it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 10,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 400,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 10,
            y: 10,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("And leave it there until you’re ready to work with it — I still don’t trust you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Ha! <i>You</i> don’t trust <i>me</i>?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("Exactly! Why would I? And I order you to stay out of the treasury, away from that ruby!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Hey, if you want me to work on this sceptre, you don’t dictate what I am to do, Durstorn!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("The ruby is mine, and don’t touch it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Noiraran",
            text: _("Uh, it belongs to King Haldric, my lord, and I think that if Thursagan needs to see it to plan this sceptre, we must allow it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("Fine, so be it! Do what you have to, Thursagan, but don’t try anything sneaky..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Thursagan",
            x: 10,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 11,
            y: 4,
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Fruby.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Hm... a most interesting jewel. I can feel its magical power. I will start drawing up plans for the sceptre immediately."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Thursagan",
            x: 11,
            y: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Now, I will need certain materials to make this sceptre."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("And what would those be?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("I would say probably ten stone of artifact-quality gold and twenty stone of the most dense and black of coal, and many of the clearest crystals in the land. I’ll also need to have the jeweler cut the ruby once I have the plans done."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("Just use my gold and coal, I have enough! Or, if they’re not ‘good enough’ for you, find them yourself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("You try my patience, Durstorn. I need the highest quality materials, or I can’t make the sceptre! Are you telling me you have a treasury full of artifact-quality gold?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Wait, wait. The gold and coal... I think we can find those in the abandoned eastern mines, north of the Arkan-thoria. Trolls ha’ overrun them, but earlier they were the source of the finest smithing materials."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("So, we will go to the eastern mines!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durstorn",
            text: _("Fine. As for the crystals, I will have others obtain those. That will cost quite a bit of our payment, but it can’t be helped. Our people do not mine jewels."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("That is acceptable. Durstorn, send some miners along with us to the eastern mines, and I will bring some runecrafters-in-training from the academy to help fight these enemies."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Kinan",
            type: "Dwarvish Runesmith",
            side: 1,
            x: 9,
            y: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Kinan",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Kinan",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Rynan",
            type: "Dwarvish Runesmith",
            side: 1,
            x: 11,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Rynan",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Rynan",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Two runesmiths from the academy have joined you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("Fine, you all go to the eastern mines. Me, I’ll stay here. No point going where I can’t help!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Krawg",
            text: _("M’ ’u!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
